    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <article class="reading prose">
    <p>Last Updated: February 10, 2025</p>
    <p>This privacy policy governs your use of the software applications for mobile devices and web browsers that are created by iByte Apps Limited (“Developer”). The Developer writes 12 step recovery based mobile apps 7 web apps such as ‘AA Toolkit’, ‘AA Big Book’, ‘Joe & Charlie Audiobooks’, ‘Sober Today’, ’12 Steps of Alcoholics Anonymous’, '12 Step Guide', 'Sober Today', 'Meeting Finder' etc.</p>
